### Third-Party Software Attribution & Open-Source Acknowledgements

Super NVM is an independent open-source GUI frontend and companion client that interacts with the following open-source projects:

1. **NVM for Windows (nvm-windows)**
   - Project: https://github.com/nvm-windows/nvm
   - Author: Corey Butler (Author Software)
   - License: MIT License
   - Relationship: Super NVM provides an graphical interface and taskbar companion for NVM for Windows. It does not replace or bundle closed-source components of nvm-windows.

2. **Node.js**
   - Project: https://nodejs.org
   - Organization: OpenJS Foundation
   - License: MIT License / Node.js license terms
   - Relationship: Node.js versions, release feeds, and binary downloads are provided by the official Node.js project.
